      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552963300804550657",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast You still haven't explained why we should care about Muslim no-nos (more than creationst no-nos?).",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 23:01:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52936433397547e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552825772382359552",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast why?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:55:09 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528250267274076e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552918798719004672",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast Why? what makes Mohammed (or any other prophet) so special? My point exactly: https://t.co/wSBJZdDlHe",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 20:04:49 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5291265162256794e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552836065787412480",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast it wouldn't be as offensive as publishing a caricature of the Prophet Muhammad.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:36:03 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5283558090070426e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552826470385876992",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast The problem is with the people that take offense. They are clearly mentally unstable.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:57:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528261684714783e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552912651622567936",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast not saying nothing should ever be offensive, I'm saying caricaturing the Prophet is way over line of acceptability.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 19:40:23 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528907122123776e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552827278124937218",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast and the bigger man is not provoked",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:01:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528270515108864e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553112672464809984",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast Nobody forces Muslims to read Charlie Hebdo, why should freedom of speech be limited on their account?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 08:55:12 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529928363173765e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552824120313126912",
      "text": "@thedailybeast @holysmoke Shocking?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:48:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528239333813944e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552834899112370176",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast Satire is not hate speech. And how is a guy with a pen more of a bully than a guy with a gun?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:31:25 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5282994991335014e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552835580900704257",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast And how would that be satire? Again, satire &lt;&gt; hate speech/provocation.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:34:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528352379744051e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552830289761009664",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast Nope. I'm just asking people to be considerate of the world's 1 billion+ Muslims &amp; not share those cartoons.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:13:06 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52829532974379e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552829314606309376",
      "text": "@AllenStarr1 @thedailybeast you're a racist, Islamophobic moron. You and the terrorists are 2 sides of the same coin. Blocked.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:09:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5282853274609254e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828522843365376",
      "text": "@AllenStarr1 @thedailybeast uh huh, but it is not irrational as u claimed to be offended by them. And I take issue with the insensitivity.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:06:05 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528280237043999e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552834523847983105",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast Lots of people are offended by a lot of different things--do you eat pork? are you going to stop soon?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:29:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5283028976100966e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828023704399872",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast But we're not muslim. Don't you get that?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:04:06 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528268620164014e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552827552470142976",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast Sorry, but it is exactly the circumstances that warrant it--we don't want to be intimidated into silence.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:02:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528250267274076e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552826168471478272",
      "text": "@AllenStarr1 @thedailybeast because they are crass, Islamophobic and serve only to inflame tensions. Have some respect.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:56:44 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5282577238235955e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552840596856258560",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast think I missed the joke on the lawsuit bit, but otherwise I completely agree with you there.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:54:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528382006252298e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828198648811521",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast  It's religion. it's ridiculous - it deserves to be ridiculed. There really is no need for imaginary friends",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:04:48 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528277541616435e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552829231131295744",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast Except satire, unlike men with automatic weapons, is not an act of non-peace.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:08:54 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5282813003841126e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552827051510886400",
      "text": "@SlagBass @thedailybeast the cartoons are designed to be as provocative as possible, as you are well aware.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:00:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528266550526894e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828130038411264",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast Tensions are extremely high and the cartoons are offensive. This is a time to talk peace, not share provocations.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:04:31 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52827552470143e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552837214359785472",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast Not really. But what I'm saying is the killings don't retrospectively justify the provocations.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:40:37 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528367878745866e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828232048078848",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast As I said, mentally unstable to kill non-muslims for doing something that the are not forbidden to do.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:04:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528268620164014e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552826862016401409",
      "text": "@AllenStarr1 @thedailybeast absolutely wrong. It is codified in Islam that depictions of God or the Prophet are forbidden.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:59:29 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52826470385877e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552825142410096642",
      "text": "“@thedailybeast:12 shocking #CharlieHebdo covers from Muhammad to Michael Jackson http://t.co/7TnbRy6yGB http://t.co/FeLfcfQAks” click bait!",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:52:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528239333813944e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552936962332844032",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast Sorry I was unclear there. I'm not saying never be offensive, but those cartoons are way way too far.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 21:16:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52936433397547e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552836787874586625",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast What similarities?You must be trolling. You really want to compare being 'offended' to being savagely killed?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:38:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528354425515745e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553111848837722112",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast What is? Please answer, why should we give a damn what Muslims find offensive? or any other religious group?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 08:51:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529928363173765e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552826655052689408",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast the offended have the problem. They could choose not to be.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:58:40 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528250267274076e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828532746092544",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast And this ... http://t.co/GOirTH9P2q",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:06:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528268620164014e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552827540382179328",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast people really need to get a grip. All religion deserves ridicule.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:02:11 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528272781249372e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552825506186661889",
      "text": "@thedailybeast @arctichamster Satirizing ridiculous, violent religious beliefs is not \"shocking\".  The beliefs themselves are shocking.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:54:06 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528239333813944e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552841322798014464",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast not sure about banning it, but just because something's legal doesn't make it moral.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:56:57 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528393315521823e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552890712212377600",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast But offensiveness IS NOT and CAN NOT be the measure of morality.Ugly world that would be: where would it end?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 18:13:12 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5284132279801446e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552829949913350144",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast hate speech isn't an act of peace. I'd call u a bully but ur not, ur just the buillies' laugh-along sidekick.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:11:45 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5282923113129574e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552840814263795714",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast ok now I get it, they can silence you if they win a lawsuit. Not kill you though!",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:54:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5284059685625856e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552992836317376512",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast it's a dumb comparison",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:59:00 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5296330080455066e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552835442551574528",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast I never said he was. But I'm glad you can recognise their similarities.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:33:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528348991123702e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552936433397547008",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast It's not the same. Criticising Islam is 1 thing, publishing caricatures of Muhammad is a no-no.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 21:14:53 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529193286189998e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552825026727407616",
      "text": "@thedailybeast regardless of circumstance, I think it is wrong to republish offensive caricatures of the Prophet Muhammad.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:52:12 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528239333813944e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828454321004544",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast So shove this where the sun doesn't shine ... http://t.co/QjdOAprdcC",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:05:49 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528261684714783e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552829532974379008",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast And, should I close my twitter account should someone find that women speaking their mind is 'offensive'?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:10:06 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5282813003841126e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552839331552182272",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast But the entire point of satire IS being provocative. Banning 'offensiveness' is banning free speech.Gotta go.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:49:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528372143597855e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552838200625229824",
      "text": "@James__Nesbitt @thedailybeast The point is, no one has the right to kill/silence you for being offensive (unless they win a fair lawsuit).",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:44:32 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528360657874125e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552827754161643520",
      "text": "@SlagBass @thedailybeast the 'bigger man' doesn't create or publish this type of trash in the first place. 2 wrongs don't make a right.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:03:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528272781249372e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553119899728773120",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast Cos they're human beings &amp; there's no need to be a douche? Ur a bigot, no better than a high school bully.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 09:23:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531118488377221e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552835237974405122",
      "text": "@fdeperis @thedailybeast no, but I don't go and stick a photo of me eating a bacon sandwich on my neighbour's door.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:32:46 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528345238479831e+17,
